 msgid ""
-"If the RGB option is chosen, a gray level image is created with three layers "
-"(Red, Green and Blue), and two channels (Gray and Alpha)."
-msgstr ""
+"If the RGB option is chosen, a gray level image is created with three layers"
+" (Red, Green and Blue), and two channels (Gray and Alpha)."
+msgstr ""
+"Om alternativet RGB väljs skapas en gråskalebild med tre lager (rött, grönt "
+"och blått) och två kanaler (grått och alfa)."
 
 #: src/menus/colors/components/decompose.xml:130(para)
 msgid ""
 "This function is interesting when using the Threshold tool. You can also "
 "perform operations like cutting, pasting or moving selections in a single "
-"RGB channel. You can use an extracted grayscale layer as a selection or mask "
-"by saving it in a channel (select the whole or a part of the layer, then "
-"<menuchoice><guimenu>Select</guimenu><guimenuitem>Save to Channel</"
-"guimenuitem></menuchoice> )."
-msgstr ""
+"RGB channel. You can use an extracted grayscale layer as a selection or mask"
+" by saving it in a channel (select the whole or a part of the layer, then "
+"<menuchoice><guimenu>Select</guimenu><guimenuitem>Save to "
+"Channel</guimenuitem></menuchoice> )."
+msgstr ""
+"Funktionen är användbar tillsammans med tröskelverktyget. Du kan också "
+"klippa ut, klistra in eller flytta markeringar i en enskild RGB-kanal. Spara"
+" ett extraherat gråskalelager i en kanal om du vill använda det som "
+"markering eller mask (markera hela eller delar av lagret och välj sedan "
+"<menuchoice><guimenu>Markera</guimenu><guimenuitem>Spara till "
+"kanal</guimenuitem></menuchoice>)."
 
 #: src/menus/colors/components/decompose.xml:145(term)
